// Helper for `fail/test_trait_sig_unknown_type.hv`. NOT a fixture itself: the
// harness only collects `*.hv` directly under `fail/`, so this subdirectory is
// invisible to it and only compiles when the fixture imports it.
//
// This module declares a trait whose method signature names `Buf` - a type it
// never imports. Reproduces the shape of the `std/prelude` `Display`/`String`
// bug: before name resolution reported unresolved names, the unknown `Buf` was
// silently left as-is and only surfaced much later as a mismatch against the
// *importing* module's mangled `Buf`.
pub trait Show {
    proc show(*self) Buf;
}
